Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dde-control-center, libqt5qml5, libqt5svg5
Description: native private proxy plugin for the Deepin control center
 Manage Mihomo subscriptions, proxy nodes, latency tests, connections,
 rules, overrides, system proxy and PAC bypass settings in the control center.
 The independent dde-mihomo-daemon keeps the proxy running after the UI closes.
